## arkive — Architecture Tracking

This project uses `{{architectureFile}}` as a living architecture document. Read it on session start. Update it after major architectural changes (new services, changed protocols, new frameworks, infrastructure changes). Prefer MCP tools when available.

**MCP tools:** `update_architecture`, `record_decision`, `check_drift`
**CLI:** `npx @ericjdz/arkive status` · `npx @ericjdz/arkive reconcile` · `npx @ericjdz/arkive install <platform>`
**Docs:** https://github.com/ericjdz/arkive
<!-- arkive:end -->
